# >>> project-setup: managed block (rerun setup-project.sh to refresh it; your own rules go below it and win) >>>
# --- Environment & secrets -----------------------------------
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
!**/.env.sample
**/*.key
**/*.pem
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/*.jks
**/*.keystore
**/*.kdbx
**/*.ppk
**/id_rsa*
**/id_ed25519*
**/id_ecdsa*
**/.netrc
**/.pgpass
**/.htpasswd
**/credentials.json
**/service-account*.json
**/secrets
**/.secrets
**/*.tfstate
**/*.tfstate.*
**/*.tfvars
!**/*.tfvars.example

