**/.\#*

# --- Logs & temp ---------------------------------------------
**/*.log
logs
**/*.tmp
**/*.bak
**/*.orig
**/*.rej
tmp
# --- Docker build context: VCS, CI and repo tooling (context root only: nested
# .gitignore files are placeholders that keep directories such as Laravel's
# bootstrap/cache alive in the image) ---------------------------------------
.git
.github
.githooks
.gitignore
.dockerignore
coverage
.graphifyignore
.prettierignore
# --- Node.js -------------------------------------------------
**/node_modules
**/.npm
**/.pnpm-store
**/.yarn/*
!**/.yarn/releases
!**/.yarn/plugins
**/.next
**/.nuxt
**/.svelte-kit
**/.turbo
**/.vercel
**/.output
**/coverage
**/.nyc_output
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.eslintcache
**/npm-debug.log*
**/yarn-debug.log*
**/yarn-error.log*
**/pnpm-debug.log*
# --- Rust ----------------------------------------------------
**/target
**/*.rs.bk
